   "text": "Jay Moldenhauer-Salazar was a writer for Magicthegathering.com from 2001–2007, who focused on writing articles about deck construction. He also worked for Wizards of the Coast writing stories and working on world-building for Fifth Dawn , Kamigawa Block and Ravnica: City of Guilds .",
